d guide.&nbsp; If you don't know what to type and when and where to typie i=
t, you can't use it.<br><br>2) The Patch Log file for P?S/8 Version 8Z, the=
 latest complete release.&nbsp; This also points out various OS/8 analogous=
 issues, limitations and work-arounds, and most importantly a jumbo sized G=
